# Monorepo layout: workspace + generated CRAN-package subdir
# univariateML-r/ is fully synthesized by `just regen` from
# workspace sources + cppunivariate headers; never edit it by hand.
univariateML-r/
# Build / RNG artefacts that may land in the workspace src/ if someone
# runs R CMD INSTALL against the workspace by mistake (the supported
# entry point is `just regen` → R CMD INSTALL univariateML-r).
bindings/r/src/*.o
bindings/r/src/*.so
bindings/r/src/*.dll
bindings/r/src/*.a
